msgid "CloudDrive2"
msgstr "CloudDrive2"

msgid "Updated CloudDrive2 settings."
msgstr "已更新 CloudDrive2 設定。"

msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "已啟用"

msgid "Configuration directory"
msgstr "設定目錄"

msgid "The directory where CloudDrive2 stores its configuration and data (CLOUDDRIVE_HOME). It must be located on a mounted filesystem."
msgstr "CloudDrive2 儲存設定和資料的目錄（CLOUDDRIVE_HOME）。該目錄必須位於已掛載的檔案系統上。"

msgid "The CloudDrive2 web interface listens on port 19798. After enabling the service, click Save and then Apply to start it. Use the Start/Stop/Restart buttons for immediate control."
msgstr "CloudDrive2 網頁介面監聽 19798 埠。啟用服務後，點擊「儲存」再点击「套用」即可啟動。亦可使用「啟動/停止/重新啟動」按鈕立即控制服務。"

msgid "Start"
msgstr "啟動"

msgid "Stop"
msgstr "停止"

msgid "Restart"
msgstr "重新啟動"

msgid "Do you really want to restart the CloudDrive2 service?"
msgstr "確定要重新啟動 CloudDrive2 服務嗎？"

msgid "CloudDrive2 service started."
msgstr "CloudDrive2 服務已啟動。"

msgid "CloudDrive2 service stopped."
msgstr "CloudDrive2 服務已停止。"

msgid "CloudDrive2 service restarted."
msgstr "CloudDrive2 服務已重新啟動。"

msgid "Open UI"
msgstr "開啟介面"
